度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","contentHash":"sha256:88e9cc038dee345a04f64543e8a95ec386e6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"build-values-and-defaults-v1","title":"种族值、实际配置与填写默认值","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"种族值 实际能力 等级 默认 默认值 勤奋 hardy 努力值 个体值 性格","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"图鉴里的六项种族值是物种或形态参考数值，不能标成50级或100级的实际能力。本项目的队伍配置单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。\n\n项目数据对象在未提供时会采用等级50、性格hardy、努力值全0、个体值全31的填写默认值；hardy在界面中显示为勤奋。这些是项目缺省值，不证明用户主动选择，也不是最优培养方案。招式、特性和道具为空仍是缺失条件。分析时应说明哪些配置已经保存，哪些只是缺省；用户没有确认低攻击或低速度个体值等条件时，不能替用户设定。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["training","project"]}},"score":5179,"checksum":"sha256:48fcf0dc827ab6c520c993413c019c7cf296aa357618a6cf7ab065319ada0399","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-4286999c0c167c8d5b6d700a6374aa8f9e2bbedc4076d9d21f180f71b506df2f","documentVersion":"sha256:2c2522ac12557b4d57530c496f95b797ff7f4e9ca8ddb3ce7642ba37fa95abbd","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":135,"text":"图鉴里的六项种族值是物种或形态参考数值，不能标成50级或100级的实际能力。本项目的队伍配置单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。","contentHash":"sha256:73532b62efb9ca2c69f7fb0502d8519c833ad2827103ff0d13c2d3a8070f5c58"}},{"document":{"id":"move-version-and-identifiers-v1","title":"朱紫招式候选与英文标识","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"招式 候选 版本 学习 英文 名称 slug moves 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。\n\n填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":3183,"checksum":"sha256:5cab5c1bc4a68580ac7433747f28ee6d36fabd9b39b1d95156f78ef09820a949","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-0817023bbaaf399e86e9e3d7ddd9877fdfe793b96c54e87f39ec570c8f317614","documentVersion":"sha256:350b8c4603e2cb087d61f8fc7dd1ce9afb98a2980112eae389917e7befdaabda","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":310,"text":"填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","contentHash":"sha256:a4cf81da0e2e3a7af1307dad29cb9dac10473c045bfc4c1c7b788dfbc89f5bc5"}},{"document":{"id":"species-form-identity-v1","title":"查询资料时区分物种、形态与编号","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"物种 形态 编号 slug 名字 form species 图鉴 查询","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"这份笔记说明本项目如何识别查询对象，不是物种强度或参赛名单。查询前先确认想了解的是哪一种形态。项目资料适配器分别读取宝可梦资源与物种资源；formId来自宝可梦资源编号，speciesId和全国编号来自物种资源，slug保留宝可梦资源名称。物种与形态的标识不能互相替代。回答和队伍配置应围绕同一个formId，不要只凭中文名称合并资料。\n\n遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["reference"]}},"score":3067,"checksum":"sha256:1e072067cf84cbf202f49f5662d9939dcbba2173aa6691027761216f866784d7","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-2c07f62d1493207b70ef66a8fe6fc3a4a2095059186a8730cee233696c02b8fa","documentVersion":"sha256:e4bf71833425a866cfa35a6a2dd4df2ebfbea9fe7dc4f7e7d64fc869c3274583","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":168,"text":"这份笔记说明本项目如何识别查询对象，不是物种强度或参赛名单。查询前先确认想了解的是哪一种形态。项目资料适配器分别读取宝可梦资源与物种资源；formId来自宝可梦资源编号，speciesId和全国编号来自物种资源，slug保留宝可梦资源名称。物种与形态的标识不能互相替代。回答和队伍配置应围绕同一个formId，不要只凭中文名称合并资料。","contentHash":"sha256:ef72150af6a5338c5c311f9ab7b9701fe026dc012a588882231f590c90a519d2"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@3a47e0c4}
