值与个体值","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"培养 养成 努力值 个体值 EV IV 性格 nature 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"","content":"这是项目原创的配置填写说明。保存配置前先明确输出方式和目标对手，再选择性格、等级、个体值和努力值。项目验证努力值单项不超过252、总和不超过510，个体值为0到31。不能仅凭这些边界就断言某种配置最优。性格、特性、道具和招式需要配合；低攻击个体值或低速度个体值属于特定战术条件，不应未经询问自动代入。初次分析应列出哪些是用户提供的条件、哪些是工具的默认条件，并询问未明确的赛制或配置。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["training"]}},"score":5840,"checksum":"sha256:a6843fc6e7d5f43c6848e242100da56e4307120714137de5e5910a833ca94592","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-2f54ab8c5292c79772e3495dee4bf48203109c70bbd8f7efbaf0413a32be9822","documentVersion":"sha256:990b0841d1b782a77aa9e0f5b698b403e7bdb83bfdec5f32cbe8e5e8b26a8274","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":192,"text":"这是项目原创的配置填写说明。保存配置前先明确输出方式和目标对手，再选择性格、等级、个体值和努力值。项目验证努力值单项不超过252、总和不超过510，个体值为0到31。不能仅凭这些边界就断言某种配置最优。性格、特性、道具和招式需要配合；低攻击个体值或低速度个体值属于特定战术条件，不应未经询问自动代入。初次分析应列出哪些是用户提供的条件、哪些是工具的默认条件，并询问未明确的赛制或配置。","contentHash":"sha256:0c23ddc8dd348678b83298b34307cf0a932fe926b7c0c05e0be04978ee48fade"}},{"document":{"id":"team-change-confirmation-v1","title":"从AI建议到队伍保存的确认流程","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"队伍 修改 预览 确认 保存 取消 并发 冲突 等级","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。\n\n预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["project"]}},"score":206,"checksum":"sha256:41c555cc67408cb4ddf470c23dc90bdec6230f4f330c8c33ba4762777eabb976","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-a8ac50bb79e69cf8b9cf35310dd2175d20e5592e0ec059fcb00a5130f6ebeb42","documentVersion":"sha256:83175ceac095f48bee8896bb5e6cbde7d8ad417c22c1b6a38eb14f023450c6ea","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":142,"text":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。","contentHash":"sha256:9446612ad41f2db05f2b2b2392fe262943b08f3794a630f9baea25cc85c715eb"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@7e3bb168}
